    "Châu Á - Singapore (Hetzner)|sin-speed.hetzner.com|https://sin-speed.hetzner.com/100MB.bin|https://speed.cloudflare.com/__up"
    "Châu Á - Tokyo, Nhật (Linode)|speedtest.tokyo2.linode.com|http://speedtest.tokyo2.linode.com/100MB-tokyo.bin|https://speed.cloudflare.com/__up"
    "Châu Âu - Hà Lan (Tele2)|speedtest.tele2.net|http://speedtest.tele2.net/100MB.zip|http://speedtest.tele2.net/upload.php"
    "Châu Âu - Frankfurt (Hetzner)|fsn1-speed.hetzner.com|https://fsn1-speed.hetzner.com/100MB.bin|http://speedtest.tele2.net/upload.php"
    "Châu Âu - London, Anh (Linode)|speedtest.london.linode.com|http://speedtest.london.linode.com/100MB-london.bin|http://speedtest.tele2.net/upload.php"
